<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2>A quality engineer who treats automation as a product</h2>
      <div class="bar"></div>
      <p>Designing test frameworks that are reusable, reliable, and ready for continuous delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g2 reveal">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ico standalone">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Who I am</h3>
        <p>
          I'm a Quality Engineer with 5 years of experience in test automation, API validation, and Agile quality assurance.
          I specialize in Tricentis Tosca — building reusable modules, data-driven test design (TCD), and distributed execution
          through Tosca DEX. I care about automation that's maintainable: shared libraries, clean recovery scenarios, and CI/CD
          integration so every build ships with confidence.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ico standalone">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>What I deliver</h3>
        <ul class="tl-list" style="margin-top:6px">
          <li>Scalable automation suites for web &amp; desktop apps in Tricentis Tosca</li>
          <li>REST &amp; SOAP API coverage with real-time payload and status validation</li>
          <li>Distributed, parallel execution via Tosca DEX with smart load balancing</li>
          <li>Defect lifecycle management in JIRA with fast triage and resolution</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

