          <li>Design parameterized, data-driven test cases in Tosca TCD for new feature validation.</li>
          <li>Engineer recovery and cleanup scenarios so test runs stay reliable in unstable environments.</li>
          <li>Triage, log, and track defects in JIRA — closing issues quickly and limiting re-testing.</li>
